            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Our new games!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Steam group to learn more about our games, events and giveaways</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491330/extras/e609fd0a2e726b94a07ad4d5875f2697.avif?t=1789036768\" width=630 height=337 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The peaceful life of Hercules and Megara is interrupted when Ares, the mighty god of war, asks Hercules to lead his army and help him conquer the world. In this fast-paced time management adventure, refusing comes at a price. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491330/extras/fdf55d8e791eee4b512e2529b09e7f3f.avif?t=1789036768\" width=630 height=155 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As soon as Hercules declines, Ares finds another way to get what he wants. Using enchanted toys, he bewitches the kids of Hellas, turning them into obedient toy soldiers under his command! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491330/extras/5e459054b40b25376824ec181d4edffb.avif?t=1789036768\" width=630 height=155 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your help, Hercules must return the kids home, blow up the factory that produces the evil toys, and lead a strategic operation to destroy Ares' command transmitter in 12 Labours of Hercules V: Kids of Hellas! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491330/extras/3d1595a421560a60b6296d02d76b9adc.avif?t=1789036768\" width=630 height=155 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced time management gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Codrus the woodcutter and face off against giant golems</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491330/extras/8c29e7db5933149994f981668a53ffb6.avif?t=1789036768\" width=630 height=215 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Included Strategy Guide reveals tips and tricks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric wallpapers and 50+ levels of new adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An extra bonus episode with its own story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23 unlockable Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Points Shop items available </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491330/extras/4346b9dd4601dbdc2d223be1ab222e8c.avif?t=1789036768\" width=630 height=147 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perfect For Fans Of</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time management games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greek mythology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Family-friendly adventures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing single-player games</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P.S. For this game as usual we'll offer a bunch of adorable collectible items - trading cards, backgrounds, and amazing emoticons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491330/extras/f1f0a6f021d794d5cbe2bec93ecb4811.avif?t=1789036768\" width=630 height=205 /></span></h2>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491330/extras/e609fd0a2e726b94a07ad4d5875f2697.avif?t=1789036768\" width=630 height=337 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The peaceful life of Hercules and Megara is interrupted when Ares, the mighty god of war, asks Hercules to lead his army and help him conquer the world. In this fast-paced time management adventure, refusing comes at a price. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491330/extras/fdf55d8e791eee4b512e2529b09e7f3f.avif?t=1789036768\" width=630 height=155 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As soon as Hercules declines, Ares finds another way to get what he wants. Using enchanted toys, he bewitches the kids of Hellas, turning them into obedient toy soldiers under his command! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491330/extras/5e459054b40b25376824ec181d4edffb.avif?t=1789036768\" width=630 height=155 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your help, Hercules must return the kids home, blow up the factory that produces the evil toys, and lead a strategic operation to destroy Ares' command transmitter in 12 Labours of Hercules V: Kids of Hellas! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491330/extras/3d1595a421560a60b6296d02d76b9adc.avif?t=1789036768\" width=630 height=155 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced time management gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Codrus the woodcutter and face off against giant golems</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491330/extras/8c29e7db5933149994f981668a53ffb6.avif?t=1789036768\" width=630 height=215 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Included Strategy Guide reveals tips and tricks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric wallpapers and 50+ levels of new adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An extra bonus episode with its own story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23 unlockable Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Points Shop items available </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491330/extras/4346b9dd4601dbdc2d223be1ab222e8c.avif?t=1789036768\" width=630 height=147 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perfect For Fans Of</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time management games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greek mythology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Family-friendly adventures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing single-player games</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P.S. For this game as usual we'll offer a bunch of adorable collectible items - trading cards, backgrounds, and amazing emoticons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491330/extras/f1f0a6f021d794d5cbe2bec93ecb4811.avif?t=1789036768\" width=630 height=205 /></span></h2>",
